            "icon_width": 64,
            "icon_background_type": "none",
            "icon_background": "#f9f9f9",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "For Employees",
            "content": "<p>We commit to creating autonomous, diverse work environments worldwide, fostering a sense of purpose and mastery. We respect and support our employees’ health, well-being, and personal responsibilities, striving to develop leaders and maintain equal opportunities.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_PwmKtQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group-1.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 64,
            "icon_width": 64,
            "icon_background_type": "none",
            "icon_background": "#f9f9f9",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "For Independent Business Owners & Customers",
            "content": "<p>We prioritize the trust of our Independent Business Owners and their customers, focusing on integrity in physical and financial health. Our goal is to deliver exceptional value and experiences, using advanced technology for research in longevity and well-being. We support our business owners with opportunities and education for sustainable income.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_qebhHk": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "picto-coupon",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Group.png",
            "mobile_icon_width": 64,
            "icon_width": 64,
            "icon_background_type": "none",
            "icon_background": "#f9f9f9",
            "icon_color": "",
            "title": "For Communities",
            "content": "<p>We dedicate ourselves to enhancing the communities where we operate, aiming to improve health, longevity, and entrepreneurial opportunities. As responsible citizens, we support local charities, care for the environment, and strive to leave a positive impact on our surroundings.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
