    "multi_column_raE4d6": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "item_T7Hxwm": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Wicky_Suyanto.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Wicky Suyanto",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER</h6><p>Wicky Suyanto has dedicated over 30 years as an entrepreneur in the health and wellness industry. After graduating from Pepperdine University in 1984, he began his first nutritional supplement company. He believes perseverance is the key to becoming the best. This core focus has allowed him to navigate through challenges throughout his life without giving up.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_jjkWwG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Wickson_Suyanto.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Wickson Suyanto",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>VICE PRESIDENT OF FINANCE</h6><p>As Vice President of Finance, Wickson's responsibility is to ensure that LifePharm sustains profitability for its IBOs. He is also responsible for the accurate and timely payments of commissions. Wickson invests in the latest financial software to continuously improve LifePharm's approach to business. He holds a Bachelor of Science in Math and Economics and a minor in Accounting from UCLA. Wickson took LifePharm from zero to 100.000 IBOs within the first two years of business!</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_zUzUaB": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Winston_Suyanto.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Winston Suyanto",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>VICE PRESIDENT OF BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT</h6><p>Winston's focus at LifePharm is global expansion and working with IBOs to help their businesses succeed. With one eye on details and the other discovering new business opportunities for the company, Winston has been instrumental to LifePharm's growth from the very beginning. He holds a Bachelor of Science degree in Chemistry from UCLA and received his Masters in Business Administration from UCI. Winston helped open the LifePharm Opportunity in several new countries the last six years!</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_WzNGbe": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Letisha_Suyanto.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Letisha Suyanto",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT EXECUTIVE</h6><p>With a Bachelor of Science Degree in Business Administration and a concentration in Marketing from UC Riverside, Letisha is quickly becoming an integral part of the family business. She is assisting with product development, emerging social media research and marketing. As Wicky Suyanto’s eldest daughter, Letisha has quickly followed her father’s footsteps in pursuing her passion in health and beauty.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_LDQEJ4": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Bonnie-Siddons-Mirror.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Bonnie Siddons",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>MARKETING MANAGER</h6><p>With a passion for branding and strategic marketing, Bonnie guides in shaping the messaging and visual identity of LifePharm. She brings extensive experience in&nbsp;brand development, content strategy, and creative direction, ensuring all marketing initiatives reflect the company’s commitment to&nbsp;quality, trust, and innovation. Her deep understanding of consumer engagement and storytelling enables her to craft campaigns and educational materials that empower IBOs to succeed.<br/><br/></p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_kCeFKJ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Katalin.png",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Katalin Eotvos",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<h6>EUROPA SALES MANAGER</h6><p>With a background in technical sciences and 15 years in multilevel marketing, Katalin has built high-performing teams and scaled networks of thousands. Since 2010, she’s led market expansion and growth strategies on the corporate side. Known for systemizing success and aligning teams under a shared vision, Katalin empowers others to replicate results and thrive in network marketing as a speaker and motivator.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "spacer_Mx48Tf": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "6"
          }
        },
        "item_mEEWEa": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Kimberly_Purdy_Lloyd_3eb18f9a-0611-452d-91ef-7b4a251f5604.jpg",
            "show_controls": false,
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Kimberly Purdy Lloyd",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p><strong>EXECUTIVE RESEARCH \u0003AND DEVELOPMENT SCIENTIST</strong></p><p>Extensive and ongoing research is an absolute necessity for LifePharm. Kimberly Purdy Lloyd has a career path of formidable experience in dietary supplement and specialty skincare formulations. She joined the Dietary Supplement industry with specialties in Wound Care and Cosmetic Formulations, developing clinical and basic research protocols and peer publishes results. </p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "spacer_Q79Gpn": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "6"
          }
        }
      },
